[5:30p.m.] #VI #VictoriaIsland #TrafficUpdate 

As we dive deep into closing hours, traffic though on the high side moving out of VI, we still have it good.

- Ozumba Mbadiwe is steady from Law School inwards Bony Camp; 
- 1004 Second gate to Civic Center and the Falomo Ramp inwards Falomo Bridge is steady;
- Adeola Odeku inward Ahmadu Bello Way is steady;
- Adetokunboh Ademola inward Eko Hotel R/About is steady;
- Ajose Adeogun inward Eko Hotel R/About is steady as well.

Our Men are strategically located to ensure traffic is good.

